    "chunk_text": "\ufffdone XVIIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s halgan cnihtes tid sancti Mommos. AU17A2 Se w\u00e6s XII wintre cniht \u00f0a he for Criste campode. AU17A3 He w\u00e6s in Cesarea \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre in Capadocia \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00fee. AU17A5 \u00d0a he \u00fe\u00e6r geseah deofolgild begangan, \u00fea gewat he in \u00feone \u00feiccestan wudu, ond him com AU17A7 Ond he lifde be \u00feara wildeora meolcum, ond \u00feonne he his boc r\u00e6dde, \u00f0onne s\u00e6ton \u00fea AU17A9 \u00d0a Alexander se gerefa het hyne him to gel\u00e6dan ond hine \u00f0reade mid miclum witum from AU17A12 \u00d0a he hine swi\u00feost \u00f0reade, \u00f0a com \u00fe\u00e6r micel leo, se w\u00e6s \u00e6r mid \u00fe\u00e6n cnihte on \u00feam AU17A17 Ond \u00fea abat se leo \u00f0ara h\u00e6\u00feenra ond \u00f0ara Iudea \u00feara \u00f0e hine bysmrodon swa fela \u00f0\u00e6t AU17A20 Ond \u00fea bebead him se cniht \u00fe\u00e6t se leo hwurfe eft to his stowe. AU17A21 Ond \u00fea het se dema hine st\u00e6nan. AU17A22 \u00d0a com stefn of heofonum, ond seo cw\u00e6\u00fe, Cum, Mommos, heofenas \u00f0a synt mid gefean AU17A26 Ond \u00f0a onsende sanctus Mommos his gast to gode. AU18A1 On \u00f0one XVIII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6s martyres tid on Rome sancti Agapites, \u00f0\u00e6s AU19A1 On \u00f0one XVIIIIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s martyres tid sancti Magni, \u00f0\u00e6s sang bi",
